                      "no": 109,
                      "type": "BOOKING",
                      "note": "**UNITED ARAB EMIRATES RESORT TEAM CONTACT DETAILS**\n\nOur highly trained Resort Experts are always on hand to answer any questions you may have. If you encounter any problems or have a complaint, please let us know straight away so we can do our best to resolve things for you.\n\nContact us:\nPhone:                        \u002B9 714 216 0600\nWhatsApp:                 \u002B44 7360544350\nEmail:                         sanitized\u002B4cdb3abc@example.com\n\nOffice opening times:\nMonday \u2013 Sunday    9:00am \u2013 7:00pm (local time) \n\nCalls, WhatsApp\u2019s, and Emails will be answered during these opening times.\nPlease check with your phone company for costs of calling abroad.\n\n**Resort Team Out of Hours**  \u002B9 715 699 92874 (outside of our office hours for emergencies).\n\n**24-hour UK Emergency Support Line** \u002B44 344 472 4920 or sanitized\u002Bac7d151b@example.com\n \nThis number is for out of hours emergencies where you are unable to reach our Resort Team and need urgent help, such as if there was an accident or illness, missed flight connections, or problems checking in for your flight/accommodation. \n\nPlease print and keep this contact card with your travel documents.",
