        {
          "no": 0,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Hi Joe,\n\nI have sent a few of the best ones across to you to have a look over.\n\nLet me know if you would like any more sending your way.\n\nKind Regards,\n\nMel\n\nMel Scott\nPersonal Holiday Advisor  \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 472 9468\nHow did I do? Click here to let us know\n \n\n\nFrom: Joe Scott \u003Csanitized\u002B93917732@example.com\u003E\nSent: Tuesday, January 13, 2026 4:13 PM\nTo: Melanie J Scott \u003Csanitized\u002Bf872b69b@example.com\u003E\nSubject: Re: Dubai holiday.\n \nHi Mel. \n\nCan it just cover that day if it\u2019s the mid or beginning of the holiday. \n\nThanks\nJoe \nOn Tue, 13 Jan 2026 at 16:03, Melanie J Scott \u003Csanitized\u002Bf872b69b@example.com\u003E wrote:\nOf course that\u0027s no problem at all.\n\nDo you want to fly that day or just cover that on the holiday?\n\nKind Regards,\n\nMel\n\nMel Scott\nPersonal Holiday Advisor  \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 472 9468\nHow did I do? Click here to let us know\n \n\n\nFrom: Joe Scott \u003Csanitized\u002B93917732@example.com\u003E\nSent: Tuesday, January 13, 2026 3:56 PM\nTo: Melanie J Scott \u003Csanitized\u002Bf872b69b@example.com\u003E\nSubject: Re: Dubai holiday.\n \nHi Mel. \n\nThanks for sending them over would it be possible to alter the dates to be away on the 14th by any chance. \n\nThanks\nJoe  \nSent from my iPhone\n\nOn 13 Jan 2026, at 14:45, Melanie J Scott \u003Csanitized\u002Bf872b69b@example.com\u003E wrote:\n\n\uFEFF\nGood Afternoon Joe,\n\nI hope you are well.\n\nI have sent some of the best priced options across for Dubai in September for you, based on great hotels and amazing locations.\n\nLet me know if you have any questions or would like nay more options sending your way.\n\nLook forward to hearing from you,\n\nKind Regards,\n\nMel\n\nMel Scott\nPersonal Holiday Advisor  \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 472 9468\nHow did I do? Click here to let us know\n \n\n\u003COutlook-bcp2s3g1.png\u003E\nFrom: Joe Scott \u003Csanitized\u002B93917732@example.com\u003E\nSent: Sunday, January 11, 2026 11:58 AM\nTo: Melanie J Scott \u003Csanitized\u002Bf872b69b@example.com\u003E\nSubject: Dubai holiday.\n \nHi Mel.\n\nHope you have had a nice Xmas and new year.\n\nWe are thinking of going to Dubai in sept this year. Is this something you could assist us on looking at.\n\nThanks\nJoe\nSent from my iPhone\n_______________________________________________________________________________",
