        },
        {
          "no": 1,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "No problem see you then \uD83D\uDE42\n\nMel Scott\nPersonal Holiday Advisor  \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 472 9468\nHow did I do? Click here to let us know\n \n\n\nFrom: Joe Scott \u003Csanitized\u002B93917732@example.com\u003E\nSent: Wednesday, January 14, 2026 7:40 PM\nTo: Melanie J Scott \u003Csanitized\u002Bf872b69b@example.com\u003E\nSubject: Re: Dubai holiday.\n \nHi Mel. \n\nIt will have to be Wednesday due to work times. \n\nThanks \nJoe \nSent from my iPhone\n\nOn 14 Jan 2026, at 17:21, Melanie J Scott \u003Csanitized\u002Bf872b69b@example.com\u003E wrote:\n\n\uFEFF\nOf course I am in until 6pm on Tuesday is that ok?\n\nOr Wednesday I am in until 8pm if thats any better.\n\nKind Regards,\n\nMel\n\nMel Scott\nPersonal Holiday Advisor  \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 472 9468\nHow did I do? Click here to let us know\n \n\n\u003COutlook-s0bdv0cl.png\u003E\nFrom: Joe Scott \u003Csanitized\u002B93917732@example.com\u003E\nSent: Wednesday, January 14, 2026 3:44 PM\nTo: Melanie J Scott \u003Csanitized\u002Bf872b69b@example.com\u003E\nSubject: Re: Dubai holiday.\n \nHi Mel. \n\nWould it be possible to pop in Tuesday night to have a chat over it. \n\nThanks\nJoe. \nSent from my iPhone\n\nOn 14 Jan 2026, at 11:05, Melanie J Scott \u003Csanitized\u002Bf872b69b@example.com\u003E wrote:\n\n\uFEFF\nHi Joe,\n\nI\u0027m sadly not in this weekend but if you do want to pop in any of the team can help you on my behalf just bring your reference number of 6995709 with you and they will be able to help.\n\nOtherwise I am in on Thursday and Friday and then back in Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday next week.\n\nKind Regards,\n\nMel\n\nMel Scott\nPersonal Holiday Advisor  \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 472 9468\nHow did I do? Click here to let us know\n \n\n\u003COutlook-zy0jbkjg.png\u003E\nFrom: Joe Scott \u003Csanitized\u002B93917732@example.com\u003E\nSent: Tuesday, January 13, 2026 8:38 PM\nTo: Melanie J Scott \u003Csanitized\u002Bf872b69b@example.com\u003E\nSubject: Re: Dubai holiday.\n \nHi Mel. \n\nAre you in work this weekend to come in. \n\nThanks\nJoe \nSent from my iPhone\n\nOn 13 Jan 2026, at 17:37, Melanie J Scott \u003Csanitized\u002Bf872b69b@example.com\u003E wrote:\n\n\uFEFF\nHi Joe,\n\nI have sent a few of the best ones across to you to have a look over.\n\nLet me know if you would like any more sending your way.\n\nKind Regards,\n\nMel\n\nMel Scott\nPersonal Holiday Advisor  \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 472 9468\nHow did I do? Click here to let us know\n \n\n\u003COutlook-rxsvkdqv.png\u003E\n",
          "displayName": "Melanie Scott",
          "dateModified": "2026-01-14T22:07:26",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~1",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 6,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Good Afternoon Joe and Isaac,\n\nIt was so lovely to see you both again yesterday, and get your next holiday all booked and confirmed, and of course catch up and hear all about your amazing USA trip. Thank you for coming back and booking your 2026 holiday with me.\n\n\n\nDubi and Maldives 2026 will be here before you know it!\n\n\n\nInfo\n\n- Here\u0027s the link for the Foreign and commonwealth office to check the latest information on travel information, security and local laws - www.gov.uk/travelaware\n\n- Just make sure to double check over all the terms and conditions on the bottom of the invoice.\n\n\n\nApps \n\n- Remember you might find it easier to download our Virgin Holidays My Booking App, not only will you be able to make payments directly through this, but you can also even set up direct debits and even begin exploring Dubai and The Maldives! To log in your reference number is 6995709 and then just enter your details to log in. Here is the full link below:\n\nhttps://www.virginholidays.co.uk/yourbooking/\n\n\nSeats\n\n- The seats will be available to pay and prebook from around 4 weeks before as soon as I know its available I will let you know.\n\nhttps://www.emirates.com/uk/english/\n\n\nAppointments\n\n- Once it begins to get nearer the time remember just email or ring me for any hints or tips you might need, whether that be my favourite sights or even the top tips to enhance your holiday:)\n\n\n\nHere\u0027s some key dates in my diary to help you with different things:\n\n16th June 2026 - Final balance due :(!\n\n11th August 2026 - 1 month to go if you want pop in for an appointment or ring or email to go back over anything\n\n8th September 2026 - Happy Holidays!\n\n \n\nYOU HAVE 229 DAYS TO GO! ! !   \n\n\n\nShortly after booking you will receive a survey via email about your experience. If you have been happy with my service, I would really appreciate if you were able to the time to complete it.\n\n                                \n\nIf you need any help with any planning or hints and tips along the way please let me know and ill be more than happy to help you or just give me a ring or an email for anything at all.\n\n\n\nIt was lovely to see you both again, I hope you enjoy the rest of the week celebrating your holiday booking!\n\n\n\nLet the countdown begin!\n\n\n\nHAPPY HOLIDAYS!!!\n\nKind Regards,\n\nMel\n\n\n\nMel Scott\nPersonal Holiday Advisor  \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n0344 472 9468\nHow did I do? Click here to let us know\n ",
