          "no": 5,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "***** RETAIL BOOKING COMPLETION NOTES *****\n\nWhere was the booking made: Over Phone\n\nPassenger has been made aware of the importance of providing a contact number for use in Resort: yes\n\nMobile contact number in Client ID: yes\n\nDeparture date: 8/9/26\n\nFFP/FVC in Client ID: yes\n\n****************************************************\n\nPRE EXISTING MEDICAL CONDITIONS:\nDoes the customer have any pre-existing medical conditions? no\nIf Yes, have you filled out the Accessible Travel Services Form? \n\n****************************************************\n\nNumber of Adults: 2\n\n\n* FLIGHTS *\n\nFlight\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nDepart Manchester International Tue 8 Sep 2026 21:20 Cabin ECONOMY EK 20 ( Operated by Emirates )\nArrival Dubai Airport Wed 9 Sep 2026 07:30\n\nFlight\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nDepart Dubai Airport Mon 14 Sep 2026 09:45 Cabin ECONOMY EK 652 ( Operated by Emirates )\nArrival Male Airport Mon 14 Sep 2026 15:00\n\nFlight\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nDepart Male Airport Mon 21 Sep 2026 23:00 Cabin ECONOMY EK 653 ( Operated by Emirates )\nArrival Dubai Airport Tue 22 Sep 2026 01:55\n\n\nHas the airlines seat booking policy been discussed? yes advised chargabe on emirates or free 48 hours before\n\n*****************************************************\n\n* HOTELS / VILLAS *\n\nHotel: Al Habtoor Grand Resort, Autograph Collection\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Wed 9 Sep 2026 Check Out: Mon 14 Sep 2026\nDuration: 5 Nights\nMeal Plan: Premium Half Board\nRoom Description\nTower Room Partial Sea View King (Tower Room Partial Sea View\nKing) 1Room\n\nHotel: OBLU XPERIENCE Ailafushi\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Mon 14 Sep 2026 Check Out: Mon 21 Sep 2026\nDuration: 7 Nights\nMeal Plan: All Inclusive\nRoom Description\nWater Villa (WVV-1) 1Room\n\nHave Resort Fees, Local Fees and Taxes been advised?Please be aware, that a Tourism fee will be charged per room, per night and will\nbe collected at check out. The rate is subject to change by the Government, and\nvaries by hotel room. Fees currently range from 10AED (approx \u00A31.65) to 20AED\n(approx \u00A33.25)\n\n*****************************************************\n\n*RESORT TRANSFERS* \n\ngetting uber in dubai\n\nTransfer: Male Airport to OBLU XPERIENCE Ailafushi - Speedboat Transfer by Speedboat\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nFrom Mon 14 Sep 2026, Male Airport , Male , Maldives to OBLU XPERIENCE Ailafushi , Male , Maldives\n\n\nTransfer: OBLU XPERIENCE Ailafushi to Male Airport - Speedboat Transfer by Speedboat\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nFrom Mon 21 Sep 2026, OBLU XPERIENCE Ailafushi , Male , Maldives to Male Airport , Male , Maldives\n\n******************************************************\nT-BOX RE-CAP\nApplicable errata\u2019s advised: yes\nNames checked phonetically : yes\nItinerary recapped to pax: yes\n\n******************************************************\nTOTAL COST\nFinal cost agreed including cc charge if applicable: \u00A3 5,450.97\nDiscount used (not applicable to OODR bookings): - \u00A3 135.00\n\n******************************************************\nDEPOSIT\nVHols standard deposit: 200.00\nPublished fare in full: na\nApplicable hotel/experience charges: na\nHas full deposit been taken? if no please explain why: yes\n\n***************************************************\n\nItinerary recapped to pax ensuring dates and hotel / transfers match: Yes\n\nHave you advised the passenger to check the FCO website? Yes\n\nHave you advised the passengers of any VISA or ESTA requirements if applicable? Yes\n\nData protection advised: Yes\n\n*Password* for other passengers: na",
