        {
          "no": 6,
          "code": "Maldives transfers - General information",
          "description": "Maldives transfers - General information",
          "note": "Transfers are by domestic aircraft, speedboat or seaplane. You will be escorted\nto your departure point by our staff or a hotel representative. Due to other flight\narrivals or adverse weather conditions, it may not be possible to transfer \nimmediately to your resort and you may need to wait up to 3 hours. Seaplane\nflights may also not be direct and may have up to 3 stops at other islands en route. \nYour departure transfer time will be confirmed to you by the hotel the night before \nyour departure.\n\n\nLuggage allowance for Maldives transfers\n\nSpeedboat: No restriction\n\nSeaplanes: Operated by Trans Maldivian Airways (TMA), Manta Air or \nMaldivian - 20kg for checked luggage and 5kg for hand luggage. Any \nadditional luggage will be subject to excess baggage charges as set out \nby the transfer company and payable locally.\n\nDomestic flights : Operated by Manta Air - 22kg for checked luggage \nand 5kg for hand luggage. Any additional luggage will be subject to\n excess baggage charges as set out by the transfer company and \npayable locally.\n\nDomestic flights : Operated by Maldivian -  20kg for checked luggage \nand 5kg for hand luggage. Any additional luggage will be subject to \nexcess baggage charges as set out by the transfer company and payable\n locally.\n\nDomestic flights: Operated by Villa Air - 25 kg checked luggage and 5kg  \nhand luggage.\n\nExcess luggage= USD 2 per kg, plus taxes.",
          "dateModified": "2025-10-08T15:55:25",
          "external": true,
          "internal": true,
