        {
          "no": 10,
          "code": "Maldives Age Restrictions",
          "description": "Maldives Age Restrictions",
          "note": "Due to the nature of the properties in the Maldives many rooms / common areas \nhave direct access to the beach / water and many walkways do not have\nhandrails or balustrades. It is therefore Virgin Atlantic Holidays policy to restrict \nover water accommodation for children up to 12 year. We are unable to \naccept bookings in \u0027over water\u0027 room types when any of the customers are under\nthe age of 12. Any bookings which do not comply with this policy will be amended \nor cancelled.",
