          "code": "Dubai Pool Safety",
          "description": "Dubai Pool Safety",
          "note": "Dubai Pool Safety - Governmental Advice \n\n-Ensure Children are accompanied by their parents in the swimming pool area. \n\n-Encourage Children swim at the shallow area of the pools.\n\n-Presence of an adult guardian inside the pool is always mandatory.\n\n-Pools for adults remain for adults only and this will be clearly instructed via \nsignages provided at the swimming pools accordingly.",
