        {
          "no": 17,
          "code": "UAE Vaping",
          "description": "UAE Vaping",
          "note": "Vaping is now legal in the UAE.\n\nPlease see below all the information regarding vaping.\n\nOfficial website of UAE Government: Tobacco provisions | The Official Portal of \nthe UAE Government (below 18 years of age, all forms of smoking/buying smoking\nproducts is not allowed)\n\nLiquid restrictions: Cabin Baggage Rules | Baggage | Before You Fly | Emirates \nUnited Arab Emirates (these rules may very per airline, however we can use this \nas a rule of thumb).\n\nPlease visit the official UAE Goverment website for more information regarding \nthe legalisation of vaping.",
