          "title": "Company - VAA,Company - VHC,Company - VHOLS,Division - Bales,Division - GROUPS,Division - VHCMP,Division - VHFO,Division - VHMP,Division - VAFO",
          "compulsory": true
        },
        {
          "no": 20,
          "code": "Maldives - Vaping, Smoking \u0026 Tobacco Ban",
          "description": "Maldives - Vaping, Smoking \u0026 Tobacco Ban",
          "note": "Maldives \u2013 Vaping, Smoking \u0026 Tobacco Ban\n\nWe have some new information to share with you in relation to your upcoming \nholiday.\n\nEffective November 15th 2024 there is a ban on the use, import, and sale of \nvaping, Cigarettes \u0026 Tobacco in the Maldives. \n\nCustoms officials will confiscate these items, non-compliance with these \nregulations will result in specific fines and will be enforced by the designated \nauthorities.\n\nwe would like to notify you about ban extended to include cigarettes and \ntobacco products alongside vape in Maldives.\n \nAs part of ongoing compliance with import regulations in Maldives, \nwe would like to inform you of additional restrictions on certain products \nentering the country. Effective November 15, 2024, the following items will be \nprohibited from import for both business and personal use:\n \nVape and related products\nE-cigarettes\nIQOS     Sticks\nCigarettes \u2013 limited to 200 pieces per     tourist for personal use\nCigars \u2013 limited to 25 pieces per     tourist for personal use\nTobacco \u2013 limited to 250 grams per     tourist for personal use\n\nWe wish you a wonderful time in Maldives and if you have any questions, \nwe\u2019re here to help.",
          "dateModified": "2024-11-16T17:35:11",
          "external": true,
          "internal": true,
